#2），这在 Kubernetes 中明确对应 **OOMKilled**（内存不足导致内核强制杀死进程）。\n*   **探针异常原因**：Liveness Probe 频繁返回 **500**（证据 #2, #3）并非应用内部错误，而是由于进程被频繁杀死后重启失败或启动中资源耗尽导致的并发现象。\n*   **配置验证**：配置证据（证据 #5, #6）显示硬内存上限仅为 **96Mi**。\n\n因此，集群当前问题归因于 `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` 的内存限制设置过低，无法满足应用实际运行需求。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 59.6s (Evidence 50.2s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.23, "metrics": {"run_id": "17b2fd339a9b4671", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.23317575454712, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评